==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**10 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Good meatshielding along with midranger and backliners like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] make quick work of the enemies here.

